c_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EhufnkAPDr8Q7kNvwFDV0Xi&_nc_oc=Adoh5D3Nj_ObMZr0RbTS3oBV50YYdJw_O5CxO1G4L9DW6db6Tw_Y-jsCrNAUhdYrL4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_zkNnWvId8XZVq3pp7LEqK2SfYTlX2Yzxd8aMJ7Na_OA&oe=6A3BD7AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rush Line - VR Rail Rush", "keywords": ["RailRush", "Rollercoaster", "RailRide", "BucketRail", "AdventureGame"], "long_description": "Welcome to Rush Line - VR Rail Rush, the ultimate high-speed VR rail adventure!\nHop onto thrilling rail tracks and experience nonstop action as you rush through vibrant environments filled with obstacles, sharp turns, and exciting challenges. Collect coins, avoid dangerous hurdles, and push your reflexes to the limit in this immersive VR experience.\nExplore multiple unique themes and enjoy dynamic gameplay that keeps every run fresh and exciting. Whether you prefer the immersive feel of First-Person View or the wider perspective of Third-Person View, Rush Line lets you play your way.\nFeatures:\n\ud83d\ude82 Fast-Paced VR Rail Adventure\nEnjoy thrilling endless rail-rush gameplay built for VR.\n\ud83c\udf0d Multiple Exciting Themes\nTravel through visually stunning and unique environments.\nCollect Coins & Boost Your Score\nGather coins during your run and challenge yourself for higher scores.\n\u26a0\ufe0f Dodge Obstacles & Survive\nReact quickly to avoid barriers, traps, and challenging hurdles.\n\ud83d\udc41 Two Play Views\nSwitch between immersive First-Person mode and dynamic Third-Person mode.\n\ud83c\udfaf Easy to Play, Hard to Master\nTest your timing, reflexes, and focus as the speed increases.\nGet ready for the ultimate VR rail-rushing experience!\nDownload Rush Line - VR Rail Rush now and start your endless adventure on the rails!", "short_description": "Ride the rails in an action-packed VR adventure! Dodge obstacles, collect coins, and race through exciting worlds in first-person or t